{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2023-08/1061719/block/singleImage/3256295/df/009_12.jpg?updatedAt=1793682135\"/><figcaption>荃灣石圍角邨。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>荃灣石圍角邨發生樹枝倒塌事件。 今日（3日）上午11時56分，荃灣石圍角邨石荷樓有樹枝由高處墮下，一名老婦遭擊中頭部。警方和救援人員接報後趕至現場，據了解，樹枝長約6米、直徑5厘米，老婦半昏迷由救護車送往瑪嘉烈醫院治理。警方到場圍封現場調查，案件暫列「有人暈倒」處理。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T06:42:36.344777+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T05:02:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T06:38:53.584468+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T06:38:53.584468+00:00","content_hash":"f5b2ce062de27b5bdda80c9fa1d207b796d6fea9e864f79aed4699cf033c0506","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}